license: Apache-2.0
abstract: "Fully autonomous agentic research. For three marginals on the real plane with the quadratic cost, an explicit three-point c-monotone set admits no compatible tuple with sum zero, so every maximally c-monotone extension has a sum image that omits zero and is not convex. This answers negatively the question of Remark 2.6 of Bartz, Bauschke, Phan and Wang. A Lean proof and an exact certificate are included. Dev D. Goyal is responsible for publication. No expert validation or peer review is claimed."
